source: crates/explain/src/codes/tests.rs
expression: shown(code)
---
$ mix install ripgrep
error: this system already has Nix, set up by something other than `mix`

note: `mix` needs to set up its own, and uninstalling the existing one removes everything you installed with it
help: uninstall it, then run `mix install` again

$ mix explain already-managed
ALREADY_MANAGED

Nix is already installed here by something other than `mix`.

`mix` needs to own its installation. Uninstalling the existing one removes everything installed with it.

To fix it:
  - uninstall the existing Nix
  - run the command again
